Multi-Proxy Gateway plugin for OPNsense.

Turns remote SOCKS5 and HTTP proxies into standard OPNsense gateway
interfaces using tun2socks. Route specific devices, VLANs, or subnets
through any proxy using standard firewall rules — no client-side
configuration needed.

Features:
- Multiple concurrent proxy connections, each as a separate gateway
- SOCKS5, SOCKS5+TLS, HTTP CONNECT, HTTPS CONNECT support
- Automatic tun interface creation and gateway registration
- Health checking with automatic failover via Gateway Groups
- DNS leak prevention and optional kill-switch
- Full OPNsense MVC integration with GUI, API, and configd

WWW: https://github.com/DaneBA/os-proxygateway
